00:08:43.404 --> 00:08:44.204
WHILE VICE PRESIDENT?

00:08:44.205 --> 00:08:45.238
&gt;&gt; Dana: NOT ONLY THAT BUT

00:08:45.239 --> 00:08:46.440
JOE BIDEN LAST WEEK SAID HE

00:08:46.441 --> 00:08:48.375
WOULD HAVE A POLICY IF HE

00:08:48.376 --> 00:08:49.610
BECOMES PRESIDENT, HE WOULD HAVE

00:08:49.611 --> 00:08:50.978
NOBODY IN HIS FAMILY WORK IN THE

00:08:50.979 --> 00:08:51.778
RIGHT HOUSE.

00:08:51.779 --> 00:08:55.082
IS THAT TRUE FOR HIS

00:08:55.083 --> 00:08:55.549
VICE PRESIDENT?

00:08:55.550 --> 00:08:56.483
BECAUSE THAT WOULD BE THE ACTUAL

00:08:56.484 --> 00:08:56.850
PARALLEL.

00:08:56.851 --> 00:08:58.518
THE OTHER THING FOR TOMORROW

00:08:58.519 --> 00:08:59.453
NIGHT WHEN THE DEBATE HAPPENS

00:08:59.454 --> 00:09:02.322
BASICALLY BUY IT AND SAID DON'T

00:09:02.323 --> 00:09:03.890
DO IT, DON'T -- BUT BIOTIN HAS

00:09:03.891 --> 00:09:06.026
AN INTERVIEW TOMORROW.

00:09:06.027 --> 00:09:06.760
THAT WILL BE THE FIRST QUESTION

00:09:06.761 --> 00:09:07.394
AND HE WILL PROBABLY GET

00:09:07.395 --> 00:09:09.262
APPLAUSE FOR HIS RESPONSE, AND

00:09:09.263 --> 00:09:10.897
THEN HER LIPS AND THE OTHER 2020

00:09:10.898 --> 00:09:13.567
DEMOCRATS COME AFTER HIM, THAT

00:09:13.568 --> 00:09:14.267
WILL BE THE FIRST HEADLINE

00:09:14.268 --> 00:09:16.036
AND THEN BIDEN TAKING ON TROMP

00:09:16.037 --> 00:09:18.205
AND THAT SHOULD HAVE BEEN ALL

00:09:18.206 --> 00:09:18.805
ALONG.

00:09:18.806 --> 00:09:19.573
&gt;&gt; Greg: THEY HAVE TO GET ON

00:09:19.574 --> 00:09:22.843
THE SAME PAGE, I TALKED TO MY

00:09:22.844 --> 00:09:23.877
FATHER.

00:09:23.878 --> 00:09:25.245
SO, HE IS EITHER IGNORANT OR

00:09:25.246 --> 00:09:27.247
CORRUPT AND I DON'T KNOW WHICH

00:09:27.248 --> 00:09:30.918
ONES MORE DANGEROUS.

